To use the Virtual Fly Brain Model Context Protocol tool, follow these steps: Open Claude Desktop, go to Settings, navigate to the Model Context Protocol section, and add a new server with the settings: Server Name: virtual-fly-brain, Type: HTTP, Server URL: https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org. Alternatively, use the Configuration JSON method or set up the tool with GitHub Copilot or VS Code.

```
{
"mcpServers": {
"virtual-fly-brain": {
"type": "http",
"url": "https://vfb3-mcp.virtualflybrain.org",
"tools": ["*"]
}
}
}
```
